# P25 (docs/RISK.md V267-V271): a GenericIon beam in the B1 sweep's shape - C12 at 1 GeV per
# nucleon, 50,000 events, QBBC as it ships on the Geant4 side (ref/B1build's exampleB1, or
# ref\b1ion\run.bat for the same dose with ionElastic counted).
#
# P30 gave the port the gun it lacked - `/gun/particle ion` + `/gun/ion Z A`, with the nuclide
# seeded onto the track (Primary::ion_za) - so this macro now runs on both sides unchanged;
# docs/B1_SWEEP.md's C12 row and docs/RISK.md V274-V276 have the numbers.
/run/initialize
/control/verbose 0
/run/verbose 1

/gun/particle ion
/gun/ion 6 12
/gun/energy 12000 MeV
/run/printProgress 5000
/run/beamOn 50000
